---
// Capacitação — página 20 do PDF
// Link para materiais de apoio da Rede SUAS
---

<section
  id="capacitacao"
  class="animate-fade-in bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 shadow-xl rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-16 print:shadow-none print:rounded-none"
>
  <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-institucional-green flex items-center justify-center shadow-md shadow-institucional-green/25">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"/><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-800 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
      Capacitação e Materiais de Apoio
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="h-1 w-20 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-institucional-green to-green-300 mb-8" />

  <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-8 text-base">
    Acesse os materiais oficiais de capacitação e apoio para o Novo Prontuário SUAS disponibilizados pelo Ministério do Desenvolvimento Social.
  </p>

  <div class="rounded-xl border border-green-200 dark:border-green-800 bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-white dark:from-green-950/30 dark:to-slate-800/50 p-6">
    <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/40 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#16a34a" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M22 10v6M2 10l10-5 10 5-10 5z"/><path d="M6 12v5c3 3 9 3 12 0v-5"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="flex-1">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-white mb-2">Rede SUAS — Materiais do Novo Prontuário</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          A plataforma Rede SUAS reúne manuais, guias de implantação, tutoriais em vídeo e demais materiais de apoio para capacitação dos profissionais da rede socioassistencial no uso do Novo Prontuário SUAS.
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://redesuas.mds.gov.br/prontuario-suas/#"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-institucional-green to-green-500 text-white text-sm font-semibold shadow-md hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:scale-[0.98] transition-all duration-200"
        >
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"/><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"/></svg>
          Acessar Rede SUAS
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-6 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
    <a href="https://aplicacoes.mds.gov.br/snas/defeso/mds-manual_prontuario-defeso.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 bg-slate-50/50 dark:bg-slate-800/50 p-4 text-center hover:border-green-300 dark:hover:border-green-700 transition-colors group block">
      <span class="text-2xl">📘</span>
      <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mt-2 group-hover:text-institucional-green transition-colors">Manual do Prontuário</h4>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">Guia completo de uso</p>
    </a>
    <a href="https://guia-vigilancia.sedsodh.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 bg-slate-50/50 dark:bg-slate-800/50 p-4 text-center hover:border-green-300 dark:hover:border-green-700 transition-colors group block">
      <span class="text-2xl">📋</span>
      <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mt-2 group-hover:text-institucional-green transition-colors">Guia de Implementação da Vigilância Socioassistencial RJ</h4>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">Vigilância Socioassistencial</p>
    </a>
    <a href="https://hub-vigilancia.sedsodh.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 bg-slate-50/50 dark:bg-slate-800/50 p-4 text-center hover:border-green-300 dark:hover:border-green-700 transition-colors group block">
      <span class="text-2xl">🖥️</span>
      <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mt-2 group-hover:text-institucional-green transition-colors">Hub da Vigilância</h4>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">COOVIG</p>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
